{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1402,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f68019f722221a966d95a142",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉能再飞得更高！",
      "source_fingerprint": "424791150e89b593557c2b30c61061aa5ca73d921cf17c1e2b9cc5b0e84fa0e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb6c4b9592e6a22f7fd63a8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "持续了千年的愿望……\r\n就由我来照亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbd3c7dc810d800809f7f857e1d8ce7d5df1a5e01b50f55b96c958c8fac612d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac89f7cd4fbdcfe8623b9b53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是北部玄驹！\r\n一起飞向未来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65115ead5c37d2ee2166d061504ace8c914a1d288862fa48841051bb90d3f071",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10a072d969eb6681006e2a6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "憧れに近づけました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64b3e9c96151d7b4cb984502b3c029431fb74d151ddb537d3f2938b9fe5ce2ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c0714df90d5bf4ac80cb5c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今よりもきらきらの舞台に…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8860cc80ae259942cf90904481ac4c2ab09f467e80a29b72d5ce336293d2ce4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ec7b14a7a4f9f4d017c8894",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あたしだけの花道――\r\nここに駆け抜けますっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a5a44b5b8ca28362fcab36f1524ec14cb96cd40b9b51f2894bac4550ae67f37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ca227ac328eb41bb020c1ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キタサンブラック…\r\n夢に向かって！",
      "source_fingerprint": "471a4de984ed1d31f055cb383d8bddf30669b896caa37355d5474f38a4987e73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:344e64d51c575ebdf5167f43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb5b5f74ef2384c6c0a89d001ced307776a3b463e8ad6c297c9c98980420a95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83ad148c8ffb20de34f6eff8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对丸善斯基小姐的感情？憧憬、尊敬、\n爱慕――根本说不完啦！\n她就是这样优秀到我没法描述的人嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "686828cbee65f35e2e8f183d47f5599adc188324cbc80f7e229bece995ba9852",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52b792573a66502c94fd8807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出门了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "495f36ee69ba563cc7c4921486cbc711ed9b1bd1d2b59f0cdf2bd7af020cbb78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c74d4dc52ec6c43995a8c3a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "661195b495376f2ba1f17ce1fbadaab1f08f9e1a9ba90fdba5b32a1dcbfedac7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7160eaf9f340db6e6e14ed0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要和训练员一起的话……\n只要我们两个人一起的话，我觉得\n不管多么远大的梦想都能实现呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d879fa2bb01d9ef8f0060d425425b01ec19f213f891a29f7d14ba4249b54a6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2a0cdf19c36c990cf1f6321",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对了，下次我把樱花汪王也带过来吧！\n它也一定很想和训练员见面的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8177664a6f22175f5c5379a08f66e9a0ee228080843cdc44c3bf6ae138126cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8cfa9229fbbf5aadade8c1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐，训练员！\n昨天我梦见了吉兆哦，俗话说『一草地二坡道三沙土』嘛！\n（注：日本新年做梦三吉兆，一富士二鹰三茄子）",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6b490db27ff311c043c913df902485aec1d0f856253b0d719d31fd1eeabc632",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ed9e9c0b226182b45dc69ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『巧克力的温度等同于赛马娘的斗志』\r\n――也就是说需要\r\n适度的热量吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3a5e5ae08dd38aa82c776844abf48278eb8141e90ba07c58e7d9b5b020c8502",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:829a89cda5e10b1bb08233c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一做点心就容易做成和风的呢……\n对了，我做了和三盆松露哦！\n要是能合您口味就好啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac4b673231538283e4d10f3a0e29be3a4029c101194f01a5da56c2fac2180d49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c5c4524a90ac5629ca1235c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我哥哥曾经在七夕节的时候赢过比赛哦。\n自那以后，七夕也变成我们家值得庆祝的节日了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "11f2bf8d183c3f79ffb6395694eaee891f973fe9c9befa23f2aa887b4c04bba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2df5b40abd8010e24575b90b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家变装的水准都好高……！\n我……\n我就只是把被单反过来披在身上假扮幽灵而已……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c597f57db1e13b8c9f96495330d919d014638e9e152afb2f8ff374b8457e78aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c63122b4327839a8e04e547",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在圣诞节的时候，我和家人们就会一边说着什么『圣诞限定，大金星』，一边在家里的树上挂上装饰品呢。呵呵♪\n（注：大金星是相扑术语，意为低段位选手战胜最高段位的选手）",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e00801c6a3087e45e268b43c25fe97d3f5becf99c95d6664ae07b5fde31ce34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bb0cee3eb71978ea617c526",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，一起来吃蛋糕吧！\n俗话说，\n『吃过同一炉蛋糕的才算朋友』嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "556213da8fb15722f31c675d78e5575ea02e2d2098a79bbf5c125156cd4102e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb5cc9a1f47ee6d2c29db6d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是努力的成果呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1da31127bda85a15e39451f2adb47c012077bf09d262cf97bc4ca7ab67df29f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7751d93cf9a00a90c7cfe9a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从去年到今年，然后再到明年——\n虽然我还是那个普通的赛马娘，\n但我也觉得我成长了不少哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f7d5ec2f097251b5cc1e3500de47fce02ee4f63aa84bfc9b030d2fe9ba57222",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09e4417f25124ea1256c3854",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，生日快乐哦！\n今天就由我来给予训练员勇气吧！\n千代～OH！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a226a528010115de55c74f8eee7eeb53d18e00fcc941dd509add6da410f9010",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25305ab9875433dde94275d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要我为您捶下肩膀吗？\n还是我来帮您做饭呢？\n今天请一定要让我帮上忙哦，训练员♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "116e90e7e99024d398a6ffc45a6eab764364ca2e04732c0a66acce8782105f80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dc434a1321598345b2a9c65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是我的生日呢！\n为了能成为樱花满开的大树，\n以后也要打起精神继续努力呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b39381c1723eb9fe35c96911c97cef04788522e97194bb91db32e9cbba0a306c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70187ffcd4e4f285c54524dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您、您是在祝我生日快乐吗…！？\n非常感谢！\n作为回礼，请让我思考几句训练员专用的格言吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba5cef3233adefc6ffd84543887c6445e922c27c657b81d4d27a5c45ea107390",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56def392cfb761555a838c05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎有新的通知呢！\n真让人激动不已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "809f1a8c6f5b9d343eada5e0aa4125b8f5de3cf82cfed0d7ded54fbe93233ace",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bfd03f74a682ddf6e154a6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物送到了呢！\n会是什么呢……\n快点打开看看吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "168543914708599062850bff2cfa391f45447113147fcecd1913727c594832e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:152347f49e56f9f7671425b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成了哦！\n果然训练员非常靠得住呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dfcfdde3d236eaf5038e33095ec35ad8ca2e9723783fca68fc63210f4c048e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fb93838172c1d9a56e1e44b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动就快开始了呢！\n好，一起好好努力，\n为活动做准备吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c167fcc475e260589268daa5e65e6e25b49274e87bd34e860aba7f73f8d36e42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc3082d19f45470567fcad02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了哦！\n……蹄铁没问题，耳饰也戴好了！\n好，准备ok了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "603e99317ce103a1da95290d485755b9fb5ce486a3e3e3437b3ce548ea4fc032",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:233ccafbede5e99415569d9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是不更加努力的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "599ba88d36f0e59c2ce490d397f513d768f069815e713f36d86c69e37d5deffa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eab719a1ea6d1cf80c698906",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升了哦！\n我也要以不输给训练员的气势加油了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8438b662190f5b46145569873aac4e4178c88d6294b7ac1aa064df7ea6b560b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6f46e1191e03330136f1a53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "马甲…背心…\r\n背心…马甲…。\r\n这叫法是…马甲Best？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57bb8cda687f4a4d0180b76e7c35ab425c9663bd6a607d28a51ac6b6deb5cf6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afae2596acf04ee3b9dd913f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胸前闪耀的，是樱花徽章！\r\n出身于『胜利俱乐部』的话，\r\n就不自觉地会选这种呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "13676085c2c265d9aed84a5025578fa72bd5bbb2f1aca9dac4dee35dec08b7f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:929229c0c1de31cd7bea2453",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢这种\r\n粗编织的毛衣。因为可以\r\n很轻松地套在身上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bb09fc54f59f0c0fe5b6803fc0ced9b38206c9bbd97988b08432b4fbc203a93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2687a7c3e291c160b4692820",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平局吗…",
      "source_fingerprint": "902444f0ed7e1616722b72af6a279cd6f7805a624cf081b4f2933cdda03615ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dd7d78a071dadf878dc4f8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是白星呢！\n（注：白星为相扑术语，意为胜出）",
      "source_fingerprint": "936dc232044873e33a48394178d3121a3ba0b4ef37c321ea5d7494d4208c0a4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d0117e944a674fae0d324cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是不更加努力的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "599ba88d36f0e59c2ce490d397f513d768f069815e713f36d86c69e37d5deffa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efe0a2350fcb053752a38387",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平局吗…",
      "source_fingerprint": "902444f0ed7e1616722b72af6a279cd6f7805a624cf081b4f2933cdda03615ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dcd6223d9e453a208dda3e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等级提升了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ed1325d905bfec4203de1e111bbc72dd1f8fc65c2ce9cad8d167c3ec733a91e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeb9a94e37df3bb47e86c00a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以大金星为目标！\n（注：大金星是相扑术语，意为低段位选手战胜最高段位的选手）",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a62367d97276f3f41cdcd3dda76212223c31b2539f566c6ee2aec193cea6c12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dda76169ebabeb2a85db96d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
